"me.help_text" = "Drawing\n• Left mouse button draws, right mouse button erases.\n• Alt + click picks the block under the cursor.\n• Mouse wheel zooms, hold Space (or the middle button) and drag to move the map.\n\nKeys\n• 1-5 choose a block, N and M portals, V brush, B eraser, X box, F fill.\n• R turns the portal arrow. PageUp / PageDown change the floor.\n• Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y undo and redo, Ctrl+S saves, Esc goes back.\n\nGoal\nThe blue square is the start and cannot be changed. Place a green Finish and make sure there is a way to it - the \"Try it\" box tells you if there is.";